# Files agents must not read. Credentials live here — an npm auth token in
# .npmrc, anything in a .env, and private keys.
#
# Claude Code itself enforces this through `permissions.deny` and
# `sandbox.filesystem.denyRead` in .claude/settings.json, not through this
# file. This list is kept in sync with those rules for agents that do read a
# .claudeignore, and as the plain-text statement of what is off limits.

.npmrc
.npmrc.*
**/.npmrc

.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
